  triage:title "docs/project-plan.md Phase AL sprint line missing AL.10-AL.15 entries, inconsistent completion tags" ;
  triage:description "docs/project-plan.md around lines 1147-1171 (Phase AL sprint line section) has NO entry at all for AL.10, AL.11, AL.12, AL.13, AL.14, AL.15. Only AL.2/AL.3/AL.5 are tagged [COMPLETE]; AL.1/AL.4/AL.6/AL.7/AL.8/AL.9/AL.16/AL.17/AL.18 carry no completion tag despite most having merged sprint PRs." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-al" ;
